senses.gloss:
अश्वगन्धा f. (-न्धा) A plant, (Physalis flexuosa.)
 E. अश्व, and गन्ध smell;
having the smell of a horse.

अश्वमार m. (-रः) Oleander, (Nerium odorum.)
 E. अश्व and मार what kills;
the plant is conceived to be deleterious to the horse.

अश्वमुख m. (-खः) A Kinnara or celestial chorister.
 E. अश्व and मुख a face;
this kind of demigod being represented with a horse's head.
